     "kind": "reception",
     "direction": "supports",
     "reading": "Melvin-Koushki says his circle was rewarded for its labours with the label naw-mulḥidān, given by Zayn al-Dīn Khwāfī, and that the R. Inzāliyya (before 828/1425) already laments the unpopularity of lettrism in Iran. Melvin-Koushki reads the label as the opponents using his esotericism against him.",
