   "content": "Ibn Turka says the spoken form conveys the holy lights that negate the darkness of the material realms, and that most of the religious duties God imposes, such as ritual prayer and other worship, have to do with the spoken form, which alone indicates its great dignity. The Ḥāmīmī Circle is a numerological explanation of the spoken form's manifestation.",
