     "evidence": "EV-0902",
     "kind": "work",
     "direction": "supports",
     "reading": "The treatise closes by reading the name Shāh Rukh as 'shah of 800' and predicting that the dynasty's glory will last through the ninth Islamic century: occult science put in the service of the court.",
