     "evidence": "EV-0126",
     "kind": "letter",
     "direction": "supports",
     "reading": "Qāżīzāda Rūmī, director of Ulugh Beg's observatory, thanks him for a copy of his lettrist Sharḥ al-Basmala; Melvin-Koushki takes the letter as showing continuing occultist sympathies among men of the legitimate sciences.",
