     "evidence": "EV-0120",
     "kind": "colophon",
     "direction": "supports",
     "reading": "The audition notes on the two earliest copies of the Mafāḥiṣ say Sharaf al-Dīn Yazdī checked the copy and attended teaching sessions on the work: a circle that studied the lettrist book with him.",
