     "reading": "Cooper's formula, 'one of the first to unify the Peripatetic, ishrāqī and Akbarian strands', is the synthesis C wants, though he sets it 'in the perspective of Shīʿī esotericism'. He leans largely on the Tamhīd but, Melvin-Koushki says, acknowledges a larger project.",
