     "kind": "work",
     "direction": "supports",
     "reading": "The Munāẓarāt-i Khams is a popular set of five debates among the interior faculties, influenced by Ibn Sīnā's and especially Suhravardī's allegories: philosophy in the allegorical mode, and popular in his own time.",
     "attributed_to": "Matthew Melvin-Koushki"
